  "name": "Question 3",
  "problem": "If $y=10,$ then $|y-15|+2-y=${{field-1}}.",
  "worked_solution": "We substitute $y=10$ and then evaluate the absolute value before we simplify the rest of the expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|y-15|+2-y & = \\\\ |10-15|+2-10 & = \\\\ |-5|+2-10 & = \\\\ 5+2-10 & = \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}\n$$",
